 SOC Analysis Report

 Detection Visibility
- Honeypot provided clear visibility into unauthorized access attempts
- Logs captured reconnaissance and enumeration activity
- Enabled mapping to MITRE ATT&CK techniques

 Impact Assessment
- SSH brute force could lead to credential compromise
- HTTP probing highlights risk of exposed web applications
- SMB enumeration demonstrates risk of weak access controls and sensitive data exposure

 Recommendations
- Restrict SMB guest access and enforce authentication
- Harden SSH policies (disable password auth, enforce key‑based login)
- Disable unnecessary exposed services
- Implement centralized log monitoring with SIEM integration
- Conduct regular vulnerability assessments

 SOC Analyst Perspective
